  "limitations": [
    "One ACC001 then field: current source retention of explicit canonical-owner mappings and the public dependency boundary, using the original qualified external SDK consumer. No D4 build, new golden-vector test, native run, whole scenario or FOUND requirement acceptance is inferred.",
    "The two source records are profile views of one real composition, not two product or test executions.",
    "The original d339 consumer compilation retains its own SHA, tree, run, environment and nine source differences; it is not relabelled D4.",
    "Static expected-vector definitions are retained source observations. No old unit result becomes a current execution.",
    "Motion-authoring Film and video-domain render intent remain distinct; app DTOs project to owner operations without creating owner authority.",
    "Current mapping retention does not assert native DTO acceptance, audiovisual fidelity, installed behavior or complete FOUND03 acceptance.",
    "The whole ACC001 scenario and unrelated original fields remain open. No human observation, product readiness or release authorization is granted.",
    "Private original specifications, catalogue clauses, raw process arguments and filesystem paths are not published."
  ],
